WEBVTT

00:00:56.761 --> 00:01:02.100
Along with new opportunities
for some people to accumulate surpluses,

00:01:02.141 --> 00:01:04.310
came new labor demands,

00:01:04.352 --> 00:01:10.233
tying most people to a hard regime
of tending their crops

00:01:10.233 --> 00:01:14.237
while a privileged few received freedom

00:01:14.237 --> 00:01:17.365
and the leisure to do other things.

00:01:17.406 --> 00:01:20.409
To think, to experiment,

00:01:20.451 --> 00:01:25.331
to create the foundations
of what we refer to as civilization.

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:28.292
Now, according to this familiar story,

00:01:28.334 --> 00:01:32.213
what happened next
is that populations boomed,